is DOSBox r4305, imported verbatim from the Em-DOSBox project. The documents
that came with it - `docs/dosbox.1`, `docs/PORTING` and `docs/README.video` -
are part of that import and are kept unmodified; the WhereQ documents that
sit beside them are listed below.

